  "details": "When using the camera/steaming camera the FBT trackers and calibration visuals no longer show up in the camera when calibrating.\n\nThis may have been an intentional change but now it is no longer possible to record calibration tutorials (or take pictures) from a 3rd person perspective.\n\nI would assume this would be part of the 'UI' layer in the camera settings but it is not.",
